{"id":"wzut5705118d811c37tnesaxo","title":"万有引力和天体潮汐谱系","originalTitle":null,"summary":"牛顿利用引力差解释潮汐成因，开尔文提出潮汐调和分析方法实现潮汐预报。固体潮是日月引潮力导致的地球形变，最大幅度约10厘米，对地质灾害有一定影响。洛希极限理论预测天体在特定距离内会被潮汐力撕碎，1994年舒梅克-列维9号彗星被木星潮汐力撕裂为碎片，证实了洛希预言。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=39359&do=blog&id=1561110"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T01:17:12.696Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T01:17:12.696Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["论文发表"],"score":44,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}